---

#### **Goals**

| Name | Text | Runtime | Goal Type | Target Condition / Enquired Information | Relation |
|------|------|---------|-----------|------------------------------------------|----------|
| **G1** | Deliver Food to Inpatient Room | **#** | Achieve | Food delivered to the inpatient room | **AND** |
| **G2** | Determine Delivery Method | **-** | Query | Delivery method (robot placement or fetching) | **AND** |
| **G3** | Deliver Food via Robot Placement | **-** | Achieve | Food placed on the room table | **AND** |
| **G4** | Deliver Food via Inpatient Fetching | **-** | Achieve | Food fetched by inpatient, companion, or nurse | **AND** |
| **G5** | Retrieve Dirty Dishes from Room | **#** | Achieve | Dishes retrieved from the room | **AND** |
| **G6** | Open Room Door | **-** | Perform | Door opened with cooperation | **AND** |
| **G7** | Retrieve Dishes from Room | **-** | Achieve | Dishes picked up from the room | **AND** |
| **G8** | Track Meal Retrieval | **-** | Achieve | Meal retrieval tracked with timestamps | **AND** |
| **G9** | Alert Wrong Meal Retrieval | **-** | Perform | Alert if wrong meal is retrieved | **AND** |
| **G10** | Check Meal Retrieval | **-** | Perform | Verify correct meal retrieval | **AND** |

---

#### **Tasks**

| Name | Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots |
|------|------|----------|----------|------------------|
| **AT1** | Place Meal on Table | **AND** | Inpatient Room | 1 |
| **AT2** | Inform Inpatient of Meal | **AND** | Inpatient Room | 1 |
| **AT3** | Track Meal Retrieval | **AND** | Inpatient Room | 1 |
| **AT4** | Request Door Access | **AND** | Room Door | 1 |
| **AT5** | Open Door with Cooperation | **AND** | Room Door | 1 or 2 |
| **AT6** | Pick Up Dishes from Room | **AND** | Inpatient Room | 1 or 2 |
| **AT7** | Alert Wrong Meal Retrieval | **AND** | Inpatient Room | 1 |
| **AT8** | Verify Meal Retrieval | **AND** | Inpatient Room | 1 |

---

### **Goal Relationships**

- **G1 -> G2, G3, G4 [AND]**  
  G1 (Deliver Food) requires determining the delivery method (G2) and executing the delivery (G3 or G4 via OR decomposition).  

- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2, G2.3 [AND]**  
  G2 (Determine Delivery Method) queries patient records (G2.1), companion presence (G2.2), and nurse availability (G2.3).  

- **G3 -> AT1, AT2, AT3 [AND]**  
  G3 (Deliver via Robot) involves placing the meal (AT1), informing the inpatient (AT2), and tracking retrieval (AT3).  

- **G4 -> G4.1, G4.2, G4.3 [AND]**  
  G4 (Deliver via Fetching) includes informing the inpatient (G4.1), tracking retrieval (G4.2), and verifying correct retrieval (G4.3).  

- **G5 -> G6, G7 [AND]**  
  G5 (Retrieve Dishes) requires opening the door (G6) and retrieving dishes (G7).  

- **G6 -> AT4, AT5 [AND]**  
  G6 (Open Door) involves requesting access (AT4) and opening the door (AT5).  

- **G7 -> AT6, AT8 [AND]**  
  G7 (Retrieve Dishes) includes picking up dishes (AT6) and verifying retrieval (AT8).  

- **G8 -> AT7 [AND]**  
  G8 (Track Meal Retrieval) uses AT7 to alert if a wrong meal is fetched.  

